From c32111cd1bf0d788f0039de7fdbb61fa85a68195 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes <hermes@localhost>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 04:36:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] Localize all user-facing strings via AppLocalizations

Replace hardcoded strings in main.dart, ui/settings_screen.dart,
ui/overlay.dart and models/weather.dart (WMO descriptions) with
AppLocalizations lookups; each class using l10n defines its own
AppLocalizations.of(context)! lookup.
---
 lib/main.dart               | 118 +++++++++--------
 lib/models/weather.dart     |  71 +++++-----
 lib/ui/overlay.dart         |   8 +-
 lib/ui/settings_screen.dart | 250 +++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 4 files changed, 233 insertions(+), 214 deletions(-)

